OL,3,GNEWSAOrange Order 'won't make deals' to
OL,4,Aresolve Drumcree dispute
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Orange Order in Portadown has
OL,7,Finsisted it will not make any deals to
OL,8,Ftry to walk down the Garvaghy Road in
OL,9,Fthe town.
OL,11,FPortadown District Master Nigel Dawson
OL,12,Fspoke after a meeting at Carleton
OL,13,FStreet Orange Hall in the town, which
OL,14,Flasted two and a half hours.
OL,16,FThe Order plans to apply for another
OL,17,FDrumcree parade after restrictions
OL,18,Fimposed on its planned parade last
OL,19,Fmonth by the Parades Commission were
OL,20,Fquashed in court.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,419,410,260,120,0,100
